# Keep the uploaded build context small and free of local junk.
#
# The built console lives in src/scf/app/console (see infra/build-console.sh).
# The whole web/ source tree is excluded: it is only needed to produce that
# output, and shipping node_modules or TypeScript sources into a Python image
# is pure weight.
.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
web/
docs/evidence/raw/
*.pyc
